Bouw een alefproject (genereer buidscripts en voer deze uit) benodigde input: alef-versie en coordinaat, pad naar project, pad naar resultaat artifacts?

Prerequisites: JRE 1.8 or higher.

Usage: sh build-alefproject.sh <target>

Available targets:

* build
    sisphus.project= sisyphus.run=AlefProject.build.OpenAlefProjectAndBuild

* deps
    Retrieve dependencies and copy them to appropriate locations. Might be useful to setup a development workspace.

Optional:
  * set ANT_HOME to an Ant installation (otherwise it downloads an Ant distribution)
  * set JAVA_HOME to a JRE (1.8 or higher) 
  * set MAVEN_OPTS or MAVEN_ARGS or MAVEN_CONFIG to specify a maven settings file

Warning: mvn resolver for ant only uses a profile when it is explicitely activated in the settings.xml using the <activeProfile> tag. 
